    "text": "By <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>–</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> theorem, we have<br /><img src=\"assets\\st0045_c4f49a05cc72.png\" style=\"width:2.04028in;height:1.4in\" /><br /><math><mn>40</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>75</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mn>40</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math><br />"
